<view class="container">
  <view class="sub-header">
    <view class="sub-title">知识图谱练习</view>
    <view class="sub-desc">这里将展示与你课程相关的图结构题与练习路径。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">当前进度（示意）</view>
    <view class="progress-row">
